OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested at funeral of teen
OL,4,Akilled in A66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested at the funeral
OL,7,Fof one of the five young men who were
OL,8,Fkilled in a wrong-way collision with
OL,9,Fpolice, which also killed two police
OL,10,Fofficers.
OL,12,FCole Worthy died when a Volkswagon
OL,13,FPassat collided with a marked armed
OL,14,Fpolice car on the A66 in South Bank,
OL,15,Fnear Middlesbrough, in the early hours
OL,16,Fof 22 August.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
