OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested at funeral of teen
OL,4,Akilled in A66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Teesside Crematorium service for
OL,7,Fthe 17-year-old was disrupted at about
OL,8,F12:30 BST and a 39-year-old man was
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of assault and
OL,10,Ftaken into custody, Cleveland Police
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe funeral was on the same day as that
OL,14,Fof PC Matthew Blades, 37, who was one
OL,15,Fof the officers killed in the crash.
